Package: libgtop-2.0-11
Version: @DEB_LIBGTOP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libgtop
Depends: libiosexec1
Description: libgtop-2.0 stub (system monitoring) for GNOME on iOS
 Minimal libgtop-2.0 shim providing the process-enumeration entry points GNOME
 Console links against. Process listing is a no-op under the iOS sandbox
 (the real libgtop darwin backend uses restricted sysctl/libproc paths); the
 terminal works normally, only its running-process styling is degraded.
